P('Explain how ether can nevertheless hydrogen-bond to water. Identify the donor and acceptor atoms.',A('A waterO–H group donates a hydrogen bond to an etherO lone pair.'),E('The ether is an acceptor; it does not need anO–H bond to accept a hydrogen bond.')),
